  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. For 6...13...15 seconds, all party members within earshot have a 50% chance to block attacks.",
      "zhTW": "持續 6～15 秒，使音量所及範圍內的所有隊伍成員，有 50% 機率格檔攻擊。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. For 1...3...3 seconds, target other party member cannot be the target of hostile spells, and attacks against this party member fail.",
      "zhTW": "持續 1～3 秒，施加在目標其他隊友的攻擊將會失敗，且該隊友無法成為負面魔法的目標。"
    }
  },
